## Title: Furniture Finder
## Author: @Aldimar77
## Version: 0.1.0
## AddOnVersion: 1
## APIVersion: 101050
## OptionalDependsOn: LibCharacterKnowledge
## Description: Adds source, item ID, quality, and collection info to furnishing tooltips (inventory, bank, and Housing Editor). UI-only, console-safe: no external network calls, no gameplay changes.
## SavedVariables: FurnitureFinder_SavedVars FurnitureFinderOwnershipData
## IsLibrary: false

FurnitureFinderData.lua
FurnitureFinder_Ownership.lua
FurnitureFinder.lua

; -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
; NOTE:
;
; 1) APIVersion above (101050) is CONFIRMED against the live client via
;    GetAPIVersion(), checked in-game on 2026-08-25. (Wookiefriseur's PTS
;    dump reported 101051, one ahead of live at the time -- expected,
;    since PTS usually runs slightly ahead of live.)
;
; 2) Console submission goes through the official Developer Uploader Tool
;    (help.elderscrollsonline.com -> "ESO Console Add-ons - Developer
;    Uploader Tool"). Console builds are UI-only and get reviewed before
